        "description": "* WHAT...Blowing Snow. Winds gusting as high as 45 mph.\n\n* WHERE...Central and Eastern Beaufort Sea Coast.\n\n* WHEN...From midnight tonight to 3 PM AKST Friday.\n\n* IMPACTS...Areas of blowing snow could significantly reduce\nvisibility.\n\n* ADDITIONAL DETAILS...No additional falling snow is expected. Strong\nwinds will blow snow already on the ground to create areas of low\nvisibility near the surface. A brief decrease in winds is expected\nWednesday before winds strengthen once more Thursday.",
